<title>USA: Moon Township, Pa., won by Boenning &amp; Scattergood.</title>
<headline>Moon Township, Pa., won by Boenning &amp; Scattergood.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boenning &amp; Scattergood, Inc said it won $1.230 million of Moon Township, Pa., general obligation refunding bonds, Series of 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.0719 percent.</p>
</text>
